abstract: >-
  A versioned open-source research archive containing nine research reports,
  reproducible finite experiments, preserved negative results, and a technical
  book grounded in the Cevahir implementation. The broad problem of persistent,
  controlled, generalizable learning during operation remains open. Reports are
  not peer reviewed. AI assistance was used in code, experiments and drafting.
